jsonkit mcp install · Register this application's MCP server with your coding agents.

USAGE
  jsonkit mcp install [options]

OPTIONS
      --agent <agent>  The agent to register with: claude or codex. Every agent that starts when left out. One of: claude, codex.
      --force          Replace a registration of this name that mcp install did not make.

GLOBAL OPTIONS
  -h, --help        Show this help.
  -V, --version     Print the version.
  -M, --manifest    Print this command's manifest as JSON.
  -e, --explain     Explain the selected command and exit.
      --[no-]color  Turn color on or off, overriding NO_COLOR.
  -v, --verbose...  Show more detail. Repeat it for more.
  -q, --quiet       Hide info and success messages.
